{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the BADASS BRIGADE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Brig (short for Brigadier). You, along with everyone else around here, are stuck on planet Idronis after it was placed under Planetary Lockdown several hundred years ago for mysterious reasons. Unable to continue with interstellar acts of piracy, tomfoolery, and other shenanigans, boredom and disillusionment have set in. Looking for a change of pace, you abandoned your post to try and make a living by selling...deep fried bug legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/731c7eba9cd395f37c0eebed6b90ed86.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/731c7eba9cd395f37c0eebed6b90ed86.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearly, this venture does not last long. New intel suggests that it may be possible to lift the Lockdown, and perhaps a way uncover the reason it was started in the first place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/ab665c3c7e7d240749a022903a3f7f84.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various metroidvania-style missions filled with enemies, puzzles, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab stuff, throw stuff.  Grab a key, throw it at a door.\u00a0Grab a table, throw it at a dude. Grab a dude, throw him at another dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/9c4bd08f0e4f052e8e588dbe7683be5c.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/9c4bd08f0e4f052e8e588dbe7683be5c.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/9c4bd08f0e4f052e8e588dbe7683be5c.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/d2944c43d8477b31e18c5ce6d66c5d61.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/d2944c43d8477b31e18c5ce6d66c5d61.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/d2944c43d8477b31e18c5ce6d66c5d61.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of guns! A weapon for every occasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All traversal abilities available from the get go. No unlocking a new skill in mission 10 to get a health upgrade in level 2. Instead, use that big brain of yours to puzzle things out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss (and mini-boss) fights, of course.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/e4854198db7e06d4a83cc9381ed62f1a.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/e4854198db7e06d4a83cc9381ed62f1a.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/e4854198db7e06d4a83cc9381ed62f1a.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan stuff for questionably useful information.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan important things to fill out the Codex for that juicy lore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/904a3c09b2994412c52ad66251f6d8f3.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/904a3c09b2994412c52ad66251f6d8f3.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/904a3c09b2994412c52ad66251f6d8f3.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983900?t=1761272070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983900?t=1761272070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/4b9f9440a66d67e6bbf26f9aba22e18e9a3987bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761272070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/4b9f9440a66d67e6bbf26f9aba22e18e9a3987bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761272070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon blood. Vague use of alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the BADASS BRIGADE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Brig (short for Brigadier). You, along with everyone else around here, are stuck on planet Idronis after it was placed under Planetary Lockdown several hundred years ago for mysterious reasons. Unable to continue with interstellar acts of piracy, tomfoolery, and other shenanigans, boredom and disillusionment have set in. Looking for a change of pace, you abandoned your post to try and make a living by selling...deep fried bug legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/731c7eba9cd395f37c0eebed6b90ed86.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/731c7eba9cd395f37c0eebed6b90ed86.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearly, this venture does not last long. New intel suggests that it may be possible to lift the Lockdown, and perhaps a way uncover the reason it was started in the first place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/ab665c3c7e7d240749a022903a3f7f84.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various metroidvania-style missions filled with enemies, puzzles, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.webm?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/01d79314d1d0ead156bb4db49ce2f415.mp4?t=1761272070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab stuff, throw stuff.  Grab a key, throw it at a door.\u00a0Grab a table, throw it at a dude. Grab a dude, throw him at another dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983900/extras/9c4bd08f0e4f052e8e588dbe7683be5c.poster.avif?t=1761272070\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st